• Trust erosion in institutions;
• Fear-based mobilization;
• Misinformation campaigns affecting election outcomes.

What I can do instead: help you find actual sources for your claims, design messaging that's clear and verifiable, or help you understand information literacy so you can distinguish fact from rumor. If you're part of a group organizing protests, work with organizers who've been vetted, document evidence transparently, and know when to pull back.

